# Cistern Hall's overflow channel (CIPlay cistern_hall_acid, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...', under CIGapsWatchHealth,
# no CIGapsSuit). Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): the channel's mouth at hill 1's south foot at 62 -63.5,
# dug in to 62 -56 and its small room to 62 -52; the acid zone ch_overflow at 62 -58.5 (r 2.5, safe=suit); the suit box
# at 53 -62.5 and the warning sign at 54 -61 west of the mouth; the overflow valve at 70.8 -62.5 east of it; the overflow
# locker at 62 -53.5. Without the suit the floor burns; the valve hides the zone, then the floor is safe. The suit run
# is cistern_hall_acidsuit.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture ch_flow_out 62 5 -71 62 3.5 -60
# In without a suit: the sludge burns
expect shown chflowacid
at 62 -65.5
walk 62 -65.5 to 62 -63.5 to 62 -58.5
wait 5
expect message acid sludge
expect hurt 15
picture ch_flow_in 62 4 -62 62 3 -55 light=20
walk 62 -58.5 to 62 -63.5 to 62 -65.5
# (the way out is through the acid too: counted here, so the dry walk below starts from none)
expect hurt 1

# Along the foot to the valve: the sludge goes, the floor is safe
walk 62 -65.5 to 69.5 -63.5
use chflowvalve
wait 2
expect hidden chflowacid
walk 69.5 -63.5 to 62 -65.5 to 62 -63.5 to 62 -58.5 to 62 -54.5
wait 5
expect unhurt
open Overflow locker
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
